     "description": "Welcome to Cape Cod Cannabis, recognized by many as the Best Dispensary on Cape Cod, located in Wellfleet. Conveniently situated in the Route 6 shopping plaza in South Wellfleet, we are a trusted destination for both locals and visitors traveling from Provincetown, Truro, Wellfleet, Eastham, Orleans, Brewster, Dennis, Harwich, Chatham, Yarmouth, Sandwich and across the Cape and beyond.\n\nCape Cod Cannabis, your go-to cannabis haven, offers a carefully curated selection of high quality products, including flower, pre-rolls, edibles, vaporizers, concentrates, tinctures, topicals, CBD, accessories, and more. With a focus on education, selection, and a welcoming experience, we make it easy to explore and find what works best for you whether you are visiting the Cape or live here year round.",
